Provide explicit boot preferences and genuine monotonic field timing beneath
original memory initialization and graphics startup. Preserve staged/shadow
registers, native-wide XFB addresses, source count/pre/commit/post/context order,
source masks, coalesced missed IRQs, mode-change field parity and region rules.
Compose after owner service0020 and exact mode tables0022. Original game tasks
and render algorithms are unchanged. Nonblack XFB scanout remains an explicit
hardware failure until genuine GXCopyDisp/VI presentation transport exists.

